     (红涨绿跌) and a risk chip must read identically in both languages. */
  .bochip { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; padding:3px 11px; border-radius:11px;
          font-size:12px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.03em; cursor:help; white-space:nowrap;
